Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nUnified Runtime Utilities (v10_9) — META / INFRASTRUCTURE ONLY (REFINED)\n\nThis module consolidates deterministic utility functions needed by the\nv10_9 agentic runtime. It lives strictly **outside** L1–L5:\n\nSECTIONS:\n    1. Constants\n    2. Exceptions\n    3. Telemetry primitives\n    4. Cost & Optimization helpers\n    5. Retrieval utilities\n    6. Ranking utilities\n    7. RAGUtils (normalization + fusion)\n\nAgentic Guardrails (must hold at 14/14 maturity):\n\n    • NO L1 cognition — no PlanObject creation or task planning.\n    • NO L2 execution — no tool/LLM/provider calls.\n    • NO L3 orchestration — no DAG/phase transitions.\n    • NO L4 state mutation — no StateAdapter or persistence writes.\n    • NO L5 safety/policy decisions — no SafetyEngine/PolicyEngine logic.\n    • NO external API/SDK calls (Anthropic/OpenAI/Gemini/etc.).\n\nAll behavior here is deterministic and side-effect free, except for the\nephemeral in-memory telemetry buffer (_TELEMETRY_EVENTS), which is\nintentionally local to the process for diagnostics and meta-learning.\n')),
    ImportFrom(
      module='__future__',
      names=[
        alias(name='annotations')],
      level=0),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='time')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='hashlib')]),
    ImportFrom(
      module='dataclasses',
      names=[
        alias(name='dataclass'),
        alias(name='field')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='typing',
      names=[
        alias(name='Any'),
        alias(name='Dict'),
        alias(name='List'),
        alias(name='Optional')],
      level=0),
    ClassDef(
      name='Constants',
      body=[
        Expr(
          value=Constant(value='\n    Lightweight constant container for runtime-wide enums and defaults.\n\n    NOTE:\n        These are intentionally string-based to avoid import cycles with\n        the main models module. Higher layers may map to\n        models.WorkflowPhase / NodeStatus where needed.\n    ')),
        ClassDef(
          name='WorkflowPhase',
          body=[
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='INIT', ctx=Store())],
              value=Constant(value='init')),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='PLANNING', ctx=Store())],
              value=Constant(value='planning')),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='EXECUTING', ctx=Store())],
              value=Constant(value='executing')),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='REVIEWING', ctx=Store())],
              value=Constant(value='reviewing')),
            Assign(
